.SS "\fBIOStream\fP * Assimp::BlobIOSystem::Open (const char * pFile, const char * pMode)\fR [inline]\fP, \fR [override]\fP, \fR [virtual]\fP"

.PP
Open a new file with a given path\&. When the access to the file is finished, call \fBClose()\fP to release all associated resources (or the virtual dtor of the \fBIOStream\fP)\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIpFile\fP Path to the file 
.br
\fIpMode\fP Desired file I/O mode\&. Required are: 'wb', 'w', 'wt', 'rb', 'r', 'rt'\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
New \fBIOStream\fP interface allowing the lib to access the underlying file\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
When implementing this class to provide custom IO handling, you probably have to supply an own implementation of \fBIOStream\fP as well\&. 
.RE
